
# OSI Model
OSI stands for Open system interconnect (OSI) 
* It developed by the international organization for standardization (ISO) and introduced in 1984.
* It has seven layers and each and every layer are interconnected to each other.

# 7 layers of OSI model.

Easy way to remember the OSI-Model.

